  "name": "Adventure Mode withholds profession experience but keeps profession skill-ups",
  "contract": "Issue #7193: Adventure Mode (211) carries NO_PROFESSION_EXPERIENCE. Profession experience is the character experience granted for gathering and crafting: the Potion of Profession Experience (spell 1008028) 'increases experience gained from professions' through the profession bit (4) of the SPELL_AURA_MOD_XP_PCT source mask, and Ascension's knowledge-base article 'profession-experience' is titled 'Gain Exp from Crafting and Gathering'. The Adventure Mode aura 302053 and the challenge description say nothing about blocking profession skill. An orange Mining, Herbalism or Skinning gather (required 1 at skill 1/75) and an orange Minor Healing Potion craft (2330 at Alchemy 1/75) therefore raise the skill in the mode exactly as for a character outside it, while the mode's character gives no experience for them.",
